{
	"name": "Torch Mace",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/lights/lantern-steel.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>This morningstar-like weapon has a reinforced and spiked torch cage as its head. When you finish a long or short rest, you can spend 5 points from your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.my42mip0qc35rcp2]{Lay on Hands} pool or a 1st-level spell slot to imbue it with sacred energy. If you do, it deals an additional 1d4 points of fire damage on a hit and it sheds bright light in a 10’ radius and dim light in a 20’ radius. Both effects last until you begin a rest.</p>",
